#. module: pos_iot_six
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_iot_six.field_iot_box__six_terminal_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_iot_six.field_pos_payment_method__six_terminal_id
msgid ""
"The ID of your Six payment terminal. Please note that after entering this, "
"you will have to wait several seconds before the terminal will appear in "
"your device list."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດເຄື່ອງຈ່າຍເງິນ Six ຂອງທ່ານ. ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ຫຼັງຈາກປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ແລ້ວ, "
"ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າສອງສາມວິນາທີ ກ່ອນທີ່ເຄື່ອງດັ່ງກ່າວຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນລາຍການອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: pos_iot_six
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_iot_six.field_pos_payment_method__iot_box_id
msgid "The IoT Box that your Six terminal is connected to."
msgstr "IoT Box ທີ່ເຄື່ອງຈ່າຍເງິນ Six ຂອງທ່ານເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່."

